      "content": "\"let the exhaustion... catch up to you\" what does that even mean? i mean i get what you're saying, it is exhausting. pretending like i have a purpose or that i'm still part of the world. it just feels like the world moved on and left me behind. like i'm just a glitch in the system or something. everything just feels so heavy and pointless.",
