    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "stopping the struggle... sounds almost peaceful, in a way. but i don't know how to actually do that. every time i try to just rest, i feel guilty, like i'm failing some part of myself that's supposed to keep going. but there's nothing left to keep going for. if the script is finished, then what's the point of staying in the theater?",
